> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @flank or sirloin steak{7/20%lb}, @cherry tomatoes{2/5%cup} (halved), @mozzarella pearls{8/5%oz}, @basil{1/10%cup} (sliced), @olive oil{3/5%tbsp}, @balsamic vinegar{3/5%tbsp}, @garlic cloves{3/5} (minced), @gluten-free Dijon mustard{1/5%tsp}, @honey{2/5%tsp}, @gluten-free balsamic glaze{1/5%tbsp}, @salt{1/5%tsp}, @black pepper{1/10%tsp}.

== Preparation ==

Mix oil, vinegar, garlic, mustard and honey; use some to season the steak and reserve a clean portion for serving. Grill the steak, rest and slice. Serve with tomatoes, mozzarella, basil, reserved dressing and balsamic glaze.
